# Named setting: the Yetu API a released till talks to (packagedApiUrl in
# src/lib/peakConfig.ts). A production build (`vite build`, so `tauri build`)
# bakes it in: a new till opens on pairing and never asks for a server address.
# Another environment builds with its own, which wins over this file:
#   VITE_PEAK_API_URL=https://api.example bunx tauri build
# Development (`vite`, `tauri dev`) doesn't read it.
VITE_PEAK_API_URL=https://api.yetu.fbcsoftwares.com
